  m_BlockIdentifier: 
  m_BlockDisplayName: GSO Medium Embedded Swivel
  m_BlockDescription: 'A cheap & light configurable swivel that can rotate blocks
    on a tech. It''s like the small embedded swivel, but medium. The head for this
    one rests on the top, safely inside the base.

    Right click to configure this block.


    This is a BlockMover. Blocks attached to the head of this will have their own
    physics separate from the body they are on, yet still restrained to the same tech.
    Like a multi-tech, but a single tech. ClusterTech.'
